#* {{quote-book|en|author=Hartley Pool|title=Stranger in Taiwan|publisher=Revenge Ink|year=2011|page=77|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/strangerintaiwan0000pool/page/77/mode/1up|isbn=978-0-9565119-6-6|passage=Mind you, I have to admit they were three of the '''strawberriest''' looking strawberries I have ever seen.}}
