#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Daniel Neman|title=Strawberry spectacular|journal={{w|Hartford Courant}}|volume=CLXXXVI|date=9 June 2022|section=section 4|page=4|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/0ba-56888-3670-4f-77-8772-8cbbe-566d-890/page/n35/mode/1up|column=1|passage=Right now, strawberries are their '''strawberriest'''.}}
